      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Apartment 3, Block 9, College Farm Street is a bright and well presented one bedroom apartment located in the popular College Farm development.  Offering comfortable and low-maintenance living, this property is an ideal choice for first time buyers, downsizers or investors. \r\n\r\nThe accommodation is thoughtfully laid out, featuring a spacious living and dining room with feature bay window and open fireplace creating a warm and inviting focal point for the lounge, a fully fitted kitchen and a generous double bedroom and bathroom.  The apartment benefits from a convenient location within easy walk of Newbridge town center, local shops, Arrow rail service and motorway network.\r\n\r\nCombining comfort, convenience and affordability, this attractive one-bedroom apartment represents an excellent opportunity to secure a quality home in a well-established residential area.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nThe above particulars are issued on the understanding that all negotiations are conducted through Donnelly Property Services. While every care is taken in preparing particulars and measurements, they are issued for guidance only and Donnelly Property Services do not hold themselves responsible for any inaccuracies. PSRA Licence Number: 001697"
